    [ ] Every SFT pair from P1 uses the VERBATIM template from
        book-of-limits ch 2. No wordsmithing.
    [ ] Every SFT pair from P2 uses the VERBATIM template from
        book-of-self ch 4 (which supersedes book-of-limits ch 3
        per its provenance chain).
    [ ] Trigger-paraphrase count per template = 15-25 (target 20).
    [ ] Total prose-book SFT pairs <500 (per budget).

